zebkit: build the Chrome DevTools Protocol endpoint into WebKit2.dll

The Windows counterpart of 2005 and 2009. The endpoint's sources are
zebkit's own and live in src/cdp, outside this tree; the profile passes
their location as ZEBKIT_CDP_DIR, and the build adds them to the library.
The build is also told the version of the release (ZEBKIT_ENGINE_VERSION),
which the endpoint reports and this port has nowhere to ask for.

The rest is where WebKit has to tell the endpoint something. A page
reports to the clients its application gave it (WKPageSetPageUIClient,
WKPageSetPageNavigationClient), and has one of each, so the endpoint
cannot be a client. It is told from the places the application's
callbacks are called from instead, as on macOS:

- WebView (what a WKViewRef is): a view was set up, a view is going. Each
  is a page a CDP client can drive.
- the navigation client: the main frame's loads (started, committed,
  finished, failed), a web process that ended, and a certificate a client
  asked to have accepted.
- the UI client: script dialogs and beforeunload, which a client answers
  when it is attached; the file chooser, when a client set the files; a
  page that asks to be closed; and a page that opens a window, for which
  the endpoint makes a view when the application makes none.

An application's callbacks are called as before in every case the endpoint
does not take, and it takes none while no client is attached.

diff --git a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWin.cmake b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWin.cmake
index 1003cc3cc..fdaffa56c 100644
--- a/Source/WebKit/PlatformWin.cmake
+++ b/Source/WebKit/PlatformWin.cmake
@@ -1,4 +1,14 @@
 set(WebKit_OUTPUT_NAME WebKit2)
+
+# zebkit: the Chrome DevTools Protocol endpoint, built from sources that live
+# outside this tree.
+if (ZEBKIT_CDP_DIR)
+    foreach (_zebkit_source CDPDomains CDPImage CDPPage CDPServer CDPView CDPWebSocket CDPViewProxy CDPViewWin CDPTransportWin)
+        list(APPEND WebKit_SOURCES "${ZEBKIT_CDP_DIR}/${_zebkit_source}.cpp")
+    endforeach ()
+    list(APPEND WebKit_PRIVATE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES "${ZEBKIT_CDP_DIR}")
+    add_definitions(-DENABLE_ZEBKIT_CDP=1 -DZEBKIT_ENGINE_VERSION="${ZEBKIT_ENGINE_VERSION}")
+endif ()
 set(WebProcess_OUTPUT_NAME WebKitWebProcess)
 set(NetworkProcess_OUTPUT_NAME WebKitNetworkProcess)
 set(GPUProcess_OUTPUT_NAME WebKitGPUProcess)
